---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import Photo from '../components/Photo.astro';
import ProjectCard from '../components/ProjectCard.astro';
import StoryCard from '../components/StoryCard.astro';
import Newsletter from '../components/Newsletter.astro';
import CallToAction from '../components/CallToAction.astro';
import Partners from '../components/Partners.astro';
import { site, projects, stories } from '../lib/content';
---
<Layout title="Local roots. Lasting change.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-sun" aria-hidden="true">✳</span> People-powered. Earth-centered.</p><h1>Local roots.<br />Lasting <em>change.</em></h1><p class="hero-description">A more abundant Earth starts with the people who care for it. We support grassroots projects restoring nature and helping communities thrive.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="/projects/">Explore our work <Icon /></a><a class="text-link" href="/donate/">Help it grow <Icon name="heart" /></a></div><div class="hero-footnote"><span class="small-leaf"><Icon name="leaf" /></span><span>Small grants. Shared knowledge.<br /><strong>A world of possibility.</strong></span></div></div>
      <div class="hero-visual"><Photo name="food-forest" alt="A diverse food forest at Contour Lines in Guatemala, with crops growing together across a green hillside" eager sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 55vw" /><div class="hero-image-shade"></div><span class="hero-stamp" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="sun" /><span>GROWING<br />TOGETHER</span></span><div class="hero-caption"><span class="caption-dot"></span><span>LOCAL ACTION. GLOBAL POSSIBILITY.<small>Contour Lines · Guatemala · ARC network</small></span><a href="/projects/agroforestry-regeneration-communities/" aria-label="Explore Agroforestry Regeneration Communities"><Icon /></a></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="impact-strip" aria-label="Our documented reach"><div class="container impact-inner"><div class="impact-intro"><span class="eyebrow">Rooted in action</span><p>Small beginnings.<br />Meaningful impact.</p><a href="/impact/">Our story in numbers <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>{site.impact.map(stat => <div class="stat"><strong>{stat.value}</strong><span>{stat.label}</span></div>)}</div><p class="stat-source container">Reported in AEF’s {site.impactAsOf}, reviewed September 18, 2026. <a href="/impact/#reporting">How we report impact</a></p></section>
  <section class="section container approach-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">A different kind of growing</p><h2>The people closest to the land<br />are closest to the <em>solutions.</em></h2></div><div class="approach-copy"><p>Across the world, local leaders are growing food, restoring ecosystems, and creating new possibilities for their communities.</p><p>We help their ideas take root—with funding, connections, and practical support that honors local knowledge.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Get to know Abundant Earth <Icon /></a></div></section>
  <section class="section projects-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Meet the work on the ground</p><h2>Different places.<br />A shared <em>possibility.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/projects/">Explore all projects <Icon /></a></div><div class="project-grid">{projects.filter(p => p.featured).map(project => <ProjectCard project={project} />)}</div><p class="section-note">A selection from our documented project network. Each profile includes its sources and reporting context.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section container how-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">How we help change take root</p><h2>More than funding.<br /><em>A growing connection.</em></h2></div><p>Local people lead.<br />We help make the next step possible.</p></div><div class="how-grid"><article><span class="line-icon"><Icon name="leaf" /></span><span class="step-number">01</span><h3>Resource the roots.</h3><p>Help grassroots initiatives access grants and practical resources that can be hard to find.</p></article><article><span class="line-icon"><Icon name="globe" /></span><span class="step-number">02</span><h3>Connect the community.</h3><p>Bring together local knowledge, experienced teachers, and a global network of support.</p></article><article><span class="line-icon"><Icon name="sun" /></span><span class="step-number">03</span><h3>Grow what lasts.</h3><p>Support skills and relationships that help communities build their own resilient futures.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="field-feature"><div class="field-image"><Photo name="gardens" alt="A member of the Refarmers community with food-growing plants in Uganda" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 50vw" /></div><div class="field-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Change has a human face</p><h2>Good food.<br />Strong roots.<br /><em>Shared futures.</em></h2><p>A kitchen garden can be a source of nourishment, independence, and connection. In Uganda, Refarmers’ documented work brings regenerative growing closer to home.</p><a class="button button-light" href="/projects/refarmers/">Meet the project <Icon /></a><span class="photo-credit">Refarmers, Uganda · Photograph shared by ARC</span></div></section>
  <section class="section container"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Stories worth sharing</p><h2>From the ground <em>up.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/stories/">All stories <Icon /></a></div><div class="story-grid">{stories.map(story => <StoryCard story={story} />)}</div></section>
  <section class="section container history-invitation"><div><p class="eyebrow">Many more roots to discover</p><h2>Explore the wider project record.</h2><p>Meet the people, projects, and youth-prize recipients across the foundation’s original map and historical records.</p></div><div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="/history/#map">Explore the project map <Icon name="globe" /></a><a class="text-link" href="/history/?type=youth">Youth prize recipients <Icon /></a></div></section>
  <Partners /><CallToAction /><Newsletter />
</Layout>
